- Track BRC/eBRC details and deadlines.
- Track incentive claims, receipts and outstanding balances.
- Provide invoice search, dashboards, reports and individual document downloads.
- Generate Excel exports based on the current database.
- Keep an audit trail of important actions.
- Support validated historical-data migration.
- Exclude legacy rows that have no FIRC under the confirmed import rule.

The application database is the system of record. Excel is an import/export and reporting format, not the production database.

